      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_mujica_002_1_03_198.wav",
      "subtitle": "完全没关系。动不动就传出解散和关系不和的猜测。\n真想大喊『sumimi不会解散哦』给他们听",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "81ea2214095c93c797f23fcb2f16ae0d24be126b2c07dab29c4ce88decc19e63",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_mujica_002_1_03/adv_script_mujica_002_1_03-Text/adv_script_mujica_002_1_03-Text.json.br"
